USB MillSO mic (hw:1,0), USB speaker (plughw:0,0).

Prerequisites:
  pip install chromadb sentence-transformers anthropic vosk \\
              sounddevice opencv-python numpy python-dotenv \\
              ultralytics
  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in .env. atlas/ package and data/artworks/ must exist.

Architecture notes:
  - System prompt = stable V2 core in the active language. Sent with
    cache_control={"type": "ephemeral"} so Claude reuses it across turns
